Package: sap-fx-control-center
Version: 5.0.0
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SAP FX Control Center Community
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, ca-certificates, xdg-utils
Description: Local SAP Business One exchange-rate control center
 Multi-company local web application for bank/API market sources, consensus
 validation, scheduled exchange-rate updates through SAP Business One Service
 Layer, audit history, reports, notifications and guided setup.
